{"title":"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the smallest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Positive\">positive</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Multiple\" title=\"Multiple\">multiple</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> such that every <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digit\" title=\"Digit\">digit</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/4/86426705a5ec20c4b0cf2d9c216ce36952e675eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Any multiple of 15 is a multiple of 5 and a multiple of 3. \n</p><p>Any multiple of 5 ends in 0 or 5; since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> only contains the digits 0 and 8, the units <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digit\" title=\"Digit\">digit</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be 0.  \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\nThe sum of the digits of any multiple of 3 must be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Divisible\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Divisible\">divisible</a> by 3.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> digits equal to 8, the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d01a8cc8d2b3fe9a418dfd66ce7d58174d1b3fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8a$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />.  For this number to be divisible by 3, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be divisible by 3. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is positive. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must have at least three copies of the digit 8.  \n</p><p>The smallest number which meets these two requirements is 8880.  Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1b02d7af1eb1dcf41c59d33033da984acff94cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8880}{15} = \\boxed{592}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice how <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf230353ddebd7a1cf4da13a5dc692ca688fb3c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot 10^k \\equiv 8 \\cdot (-5)^k \\equiv 5 \\pmod{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"257\" height=\"22\" /> for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84c0da6f9bb05c6b3f2db89eea12691e4b79066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. Since we are restricted to only the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a237b8ebb3b2ae7c2a805f38c4d14fc6a9100c3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8,0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" />, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61d41db57108628df03904e552705aa7bd29de7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\equiv -7 \\pmod{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" /> we can't have an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the optimal smallest number. We can just 'add' fives to quickly get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/68587743d1384eb4b4620e9b784d0d9fda793928.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" /> to get our answer. Thus n is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62cdab29e10b439dac9d0b5647b0aba9c0feac1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80+800+8000=8880$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"189\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839433d8a2c2180b990f7d147c5e5b83b3fd2ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/15=8880/15=\\boxed{592}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"191\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Any number that consists only of the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is itself divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> therefore is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Furthermore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must end in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since it is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and all multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> will end in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore may write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/7328f14e58f960af0b660f85cd9e168c421269b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot k = 15m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" /> to express that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is simultaneously a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Going up by multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, among three digit numbers we only have to check <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd39493493659fb36ab2875b266a4874b475f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$840$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> which clearly does not satisfy the condition of our problem. Among four digit numbers, you encounter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec810e475f2fe15d2187dc7684f6f5cf2f47631.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8040, 8160, 8280, 8400, 8520, 8640, 8760, 8880$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" /> -- this last number corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/8/208a55b5c85104793acf049757bc2a186471b69f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583beb1b457659edcad43418034d25124b8a6904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m =  \\boxed{592}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"81\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME\" title=\"1984 AIME\">1984 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\">AIME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">American Invitational Mathematics Examination</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017174618\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 304/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1431/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7963/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.886      1 Template:AIME_box\n100.00%    7.886      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2774:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017174618 and revision id 282706. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}